CCTPBridgeModule_EncodeDecodeParams
├── when encoding valid params
│   └── it should produce abi-encoded routing parameters
├── when decoding valid encoded bytes
│   └── it should return all original routing parameters
├── when round-tripping encode then decode
│   └── it should recover the original params including hookData
└── fuzz
    └── it should round-trip any valid domain, recipient, maxFee, and finality [fuzz]
